At folder head, RUN:
python3 dist_example.py --rank 0 --world_size 2 --ip 127.0.0.0
At folder worker, RUN:
python3 dist_example.py --rank 1 --world_size 2 --ip 127.0.0.0

Expected output from head terminal:
../head$ python3 dist_example.py --rank 0 --world_size 2 --ip 127.0.0.0
Starting on rank 0, connecting to master at 127.0.0.0
Initializing process group...
Process group initialized.
Rank 0 is sending tensor to Rank 1
Rank 0 has tensor tensor([1.])


Expected output from worker terminal:
../worker$ python3 dist_example.py --rank 1 --world_size 2 --ip 127.0.0.0
Starting on rank 1, connecting to master at 127.0.0.0
Initializing process group...
Process group initialized.
Rank 1 is receiving tensor from Rank 0
Rank 1 has tensor tensor([1.])
